{
  "id": "1SA.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samweli 1",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elikana na Abanto b’enka yaye agwo Silo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nareenge omonto ore korokwa Elikana korwa ase egesaku gia Efraimu, omenyete Ramataimu‐Sofimu, ase ebitunwa bi’ense ya Efraimu. Ere nigo areenge mosinto o Yerohamu bw’Elihu, o Tohu, o Sufu, Omoefraimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elikana nabwate abakungu babere, Ana na Penina. Penina nabwate abana, korende Ana tabwate bana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera omwaka omonto oyio nigo areenge gotiira korwa ase omochie oye, ogenda gosasiima na korua ebing’wanso ase Omonene bw’Emeganda agwo Silo. Aroro agwo Ofini na Finehasi, abamura babere ba Eli, nigo baarenge abakuani ba Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera engaki Elikana areenge korua ekeng’wanso, nigo areenge koa Penina amo nabana baye, abamura na abaiseke, kera oyomo egetari kiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ase Ana nigo areenge komoa ebitari bibere, ekiagera nigo amwanchete nony’Omonene osiegete oroiboro rwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Penina, moibori omwabo, nigo anarete goichania Ana ase okomochaaya, ekiagera Omonene konya osiekire okoibora kwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo agendererete gokora boigo, kera engaki, omwaka ase omwaka. Ekero baareenge kogenda gosasiima ase enyomba y’Omonene, Penina akaba ogoichania Ana, na Ana nigo areenge kona‐korera goika takoria gento.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Elikana akamobooria: “Nase ki okona‐korera iga? Naki otari koria endagera? Naende oichaanete iga? Inee! Inche tingoisaini goetania abana abamura ikomi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ana na Eli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko erimo magega kobakoorire koragera na konywa aaria Silo, Ana akaimoka, na ase emechando yaye akarera mono kegima, ore nobororo, agasaba Omonene. Eli Omokuani nao aikaransete ase ekerogo kiaye ang’e nomotobwa bw’egesieri gie Hekalu y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana nigo arenge nobororo obonge mono, ere agasaba na akaria eira, agakwana",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Omonene bw’Emeganda, ondigererie inche omosomba oo ase emechando yane! Tonyeba! Korang’e omwana omomura, nigo ndamorue abe oyoo, aye Omonene; ase amatuko onsi ay’obogima bwaye takogingirwa etukia yaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buna omokungu oyio agendererete gosaba Omonene, Eli akaba origereretie omonwa oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana nigo areenge gosabera enkoro yaye ime bokiriru; akaba okomonya‐monyia ebikoba biaye rioka, korende riogi tiriare koigweka. Ase ayio Eli agakaga ng’a Ana nigo atindire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akamoteebia: “Ngoika ririri oragenderere gotinda? Tiga ogotinda kwao, otindoke!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana akamoiraneria, “Taibo, omonene one, inche nomokuungu inde nobororo ase enkoro yane. Tinyweti edivai gose ekenyugwa kende kegotindia. Nigo nabeire ngosaba na kobeeka emechando yane yonsi ase Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tokaga ng’a inche, omosomba oo, nomokuungu otagwenereti, inaki ase engaki eye yonsi nabeire ngokwana ase engencho y’emechando yane na ogoichana kwane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Eli akamoiraneria, akamoteebia: “Genda nomorembe, na Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli nakoe aya kwamosabire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana akabora, “Tiga inche, omosomba oo, inyore ogwancherwa ase obosio bwao.” Erio omokungu oria akarua aase agwo, akagenda koragera, gose taba oichaanete naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okoiborwa gwa Samweli na ogwatananwa kwaye ase Omonene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko ria kabere Elikana na Abanto baye bakaimoka mambia chuni, bagasasiima ase obosio bw’Omonene. Erio bakairana gochia nka sobo agwo Rama. Elikana akaba na Ana mokaye, n’Omonene akaba omoinyorete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana akaba morito, na ekero engaki yaigete akaibora omwana omoisia, akamoroka Samweli, agateeba, “Nekiagera namosabete korwa ase Omonene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elikana amo na’baanto b’enka yaye bakagenda naende koruera Omonene ekeng’wanso gia kera omwaka na goikerania eira bariete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ase engaki eyio Ana tagendeteo, agateebia omosacha oye, “Ninganye goika ’ntache omwana, erio nario ndamoire imoorokie ase obosio bw’Omonene, erinde imotige amenye aroro botaambe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elikana, omosacha oye, akamoteebia, “Kora aya orarore are buya; ganya goika otache omwana. Tiga Omonene aikeranie ring’ana riaye.” Erio omokungu oria agatigara nka korera omwana goika akamotacha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omwana oria atachirwe, Ana akamoira ase enyomba y’Omonene agwo Silo, akairana eeri yakoorire emiaka etato, n’obosie ebimunu emerongo ebere, na ekerandi kiaroisirie korwa ase risankwa kere nedivai. Omwana oria omomura nigo areenge omoke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio bakanyenya eeri eria, na bakaa Eli omwana oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana agateebia Eli, “Omonene one, inyigwa. Amaene, buna ogendererete koba moyo, inche nomokuungu oria natenenete aiga ase obosio bwao, nareenge gosaba Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo nasabete ng’a ’ng’eegwe omwana oyo omomura, n’Omonene akaigwa ogosaba kwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio namorentire ase Omonene. Ase obogima bwaye bwonsi abe oyoye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Erio bagasasiima Omonene aroro agwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "1SA.2",
    "number": "2",
    "bookId": "1SA"
  },
